[gd_resource type="Theme" format=3 uid="uid://byx8sircsks0l"]

; Overload Protocol default Theme â€” MIRRORS the canonical PixelUI DT_* palette
; (scripts/ui/pixel_ui.gd). This only provides default font + per-Control-type
; default styles so NEW Control nodes inherit the Dithered-Terminal baseline
; without per-node code. The battle screen's signature look (dither overlays,
; per-side card tints, dynamic dividers, bevels) stays programmatic in PixelUI.
; Do NOT hand-edit colors here independently â€” keep them equal to PixelUI.

